"specific snapshot of the SDK (e.g. 6.1). Furthermore, *target* represents"
" the target architecture (e.g. ``i586``) and *host* represents the "
"development system's architecture (e.g. ``x86_64``). Thus, the complete "
"names of the two directories within the ``sysroots`` could be ``i586"
