msgid ""
"*Case 2 --- Variables Are Set in the Makefile that Map to Equivalent "
"Environment Variables from the SDK Setup Script:* Specifically setting "
"matching variables in the ``Makefile`` during the build results in the "
"environment settings of the variables being overwritten. In this case, "
"the variables you set in the ``Makefile`` are used."
